g\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vORzDiWl5mxm6nuXQu9h5bhi6rb.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A mysterious man arrives at the offices of an FBI agent and recounts his childhood: how his religious fanatic father received visions telling him to kill people who were in fact \\\"demons.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":841742,\"title\":\"Megalomaniac\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8HKjrjwTjvDscC9uZNk6dCRHcfd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xmwHKkDrTAOFK2odRJFpeKp3eEx.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Felix and Martha, the two offspring of legendary serial murderer The Skinner of Mons, grapple with the grotesque legacy bequeathed to them. While Martha works a menial janitorial job, Felix continues his father's reign of terror. But following a brutal attack at work, Martha quickly descends into madness, finding she must come to terms with the infamous blood that flows through her veins.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":272447,\"title\":\"The Circle\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/15iKPQxId1B8nVbAgQuvFpPXmR6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fswY9l4Gb240G6TpQpxjV0Svkhj.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A serial killer whose modus operandi includes painting abstract designs on his victims prior to raping, killing, and eating them is captured and interrogated by a hardened district attorney. When the maniac fails to provide answers satisfying both the prosecution and defense attorneys, he is hypnotized and shocking secrets begin to emerge.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460914,\"title\":\"Death Pool\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5wuzujPvYGKPT1MsEt9onhLK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22fCjndmY1yGs9S4w3KZos98kXQ.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Johnny Taylor has a big problem: he LOVES to drown good-looking girls. When he sees water and attractive females together, something in his head begs him to kill - the psychological result of a traumatic near-drowning during his childhood at the hands of a twisted babysitter. Fighting the urge to act on his sinister thoughts most of his adult life, Johnny finally succumbs to his dark instincts when the only work he can find is around water, cleaning pools. Filled with colorful characters, beautiful women and set against the backdrop of the LA party scene, Death Pool encapsulates the desire for fame, the lust for desire, and the urge to kill.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5857,\"title\":\"I Know Who Killed Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hz8jYHGNsNsnF0FPngxQEEVyR6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cHX3TG0rsd9jQu1aVDb0ZgDeyCJ.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An idyllic small town is rocked when Aubrey Fleming, a bright and promising young woman, is abducted and tortured by a sadistic serial killer. When she manages to escape, the traumatized girl who regains consciousness in the hospital insists that she is not who they think she is and that the real Aubrey Fleming is still in mortal danger.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234369,\"title\":\"Dinner Party\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yPr6y8r2fKgOz60NQRbHjqHrXxb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Best friends Will and Alan plan to have a dinner party together. Alan must reconcile with a decision he made that night.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1234386,\"title\":\"The Neighbor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AsJ4KHSxSp7VCqJ6LViqdWzerjw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"ra